{
  "openapi": "3.0.3",
  "info": {
    "title": "yy_easy_aiapi — AI 代理网关 API",
    "description": "轻量级 AI 代理网关，提供统一的 AI 接口调用、渠道管理、Token 鉴权与计费能力。\n\n## 鉴权方式\n\n### 1. TokenAuth（AI 代理鉴权）\n用于调用 AI 聊天补全接口。在请求头中添加：\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer {系统生成的Token}\n```\n\n### 2. ApiTokenAuth（管理 API 鉴权）\n用于调用所有渠道管理、Token 管理、积分操作、流水查询、计费设置接口。在请求头中添加：\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer {api_token}\n```\n\n## 统一响应格式\n所有 API 响应均为标准 JSON 格式：\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": { ... },\n  \"error\": null,\n  \"message\": null\n}\n```\n\n错误响应：\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"data\": null,\n  \"error\": {\n    \"code\": 401,\n    \"message\": \"错误描述\"\n  },\n  \"message\": \"错误描述\"\n}\n```\n\n## 计费公式\n**最终价格 = 渠道价格 × 倍率 × 100**\n\n其中：\n- 渠道价格：各渠道中配置的单价（元/单位）\n- 倍率：在计费设置中配置的全局倍率（默认 1.0）\n- 最终价格以积分为单位（1 元 = 100 积分）",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "contact": {
      "name": "yy_easy_aiapi"
    }
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "/yy_easy_aiapi",
      "description": "yy_easy_aiapi API 基础路径（部署时需包含此前缀）"
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    { "name": "AI 代理", "description": "AI 聊天补全接口（兼容 OpenAI 格式），使用系统生成的 Token 鉴权" },
    { "name": "渠道管理", "description": "渠道的增删改查管理" },
    { "name": "Token 管理", "description": "API Token 的生成、查询和删除" },
    { "name": "积分管理", "description": "Token 的充值与扣减操作" },
    { "name": "流水查询", "description": "查询积分变动流水" },
    { "name": "计费设置", "description": "配置全局计费倍率" },
    { "name": "管理员认证", "description": "管理后台的登录与登出" }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/v1/chat/completions": {
      "post": {
        "tags": ["AI 代理"],
        "summary": "AI 聊天补全",
        "description": "兼容 OpenAI 格式的聊天补全接口，支持流式（SSE）和非流式返回。\n\n- 模型名称（model）使用**渠道名**进行路由\n- 流式返回使用 Server-Sent Events（SSE）协议\n- 自动扣减 Token 余额\n- 自动记录计费流水\n\n### 请求示例\n```json\n{\n  \"model\": \"gpt-4o\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\"role\": \"system\", \"content\": \"你是一个有用的助手\"},\n    {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"你好，请介绍一下你自己\"}\n  ],\n  \"stream\": false\n}\n```",
        "operationId": "chatCompletions",
        "security": [{ "TokenAuth": [] }],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": ["model", "messages"],
                "properties": {
                  "model": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "模型名称，对应**渠道名**。系统会根据此名称路由到对应的上游渠道",
                    "example": "gpt-4o"
                  },
                  "messages": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "description": "对话消息列表",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "required": ["role", "content"],
                      "properties": {
                        "role": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "description": "消息角色",
                          "enum": ["system", "user", "assistant"],
                          "example": "user"
                        },
                        "content": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "description": "消息内容",
                          "example": "你好，请介绍一下你自己"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "stream": {
                    "type": "boolean",
                    "description": "是否使用流式返回。设为 true 时返回 SSE 流，false 时返回完整 JSON",
                    "default": false,
                    "example": false
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "成功响应。非流式返回完整 JSON；流式返回 SSE 事件流",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "description": "兼容 OpenAI 的聊天补全响应格式",
                  "properties": {
                    "id": { "type": "string", "description": "请求唯一标识" },
                    "object": { "type": "string", "description": "响应类型，固定为 chat.completion" },
                    "created": { "type": "integer", "description": "创建时间戳" },
                    "model": { "type": "string", "description": "使用的模型名称" },
                    "choices": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "index": { "type": "integer" },
                          "message": {
                            "type": "object",
                            "properties": {
                              "role": { "type": "string" },
                              "content": { "type": "string" }
                            }
                          },
                          "finish_reason": { "type": "string" }
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "usage": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "prompt_tokens": { "type": "integer" },
                        "completion_tokens": { "type": "integer" },
                        "total_tokens": { "type": "integer" }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "text/event-stream": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "SSE 事件流，每个事件为 data: {json}\\n\\n 格式"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "请求参数错误",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse" }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "鉴权失败 - Token 无效或未提供",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse" }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "余额不足或并发超限",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse" }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "请求频率超限",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse" }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "服务器内部错误",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse" }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/channels": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["渠道管理"],
        "summary": "获取渠道列表",
        "description": "获取所有已配置的 AI 渠道列表。每个渠道代表一个上游 AI 服务提供商。\n\n### 响应示例\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 1,\n      \"name\": \"gpt-4o\",\n      \"api_standard\": \"openai\",\n      \"price_input\": \"0.01\",\n      \"price_cached\": \"0.005\",\n      \"price_output\": \"0.03\",\n      \"rate_input\": \"1.0\",\n      \"rate_cached\": \"1.0\",\n      \"rate_output\": \"1.0\",\n      \"upstream_url\": \"https://api.openai.com/v1\",\n      \"api_key\": \"sk-xxx\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2025-01-01T00:00:00\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2025-01-01T00:00:00\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```",
        "operationId": "listChannels",
        "security": [{ "ApiTokenAuth": [] }],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "成功返回渠道列表",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "success": { "type": "boolean", "example": true },
                    "data": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChannelInfo" }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" }
        }
      },
      "post": {
        "tags": ["渠道管理"],
        "summary": "创建渠道",
        "description": "创建一个新的 AI 渠道。创建成功后返回完整的渠道信息。\n\n### 请求示例\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"gpt-4o\",\n  \"api_standard\": \"openai\",\n  \"price_input\": \"0.01\",\n  \"price_cached\": \"0.005\",\n  \"price_output\": \"0.03\",\n  \"rate_input\": \"1.0\",\n  \"rate_cached\": \"1.0\",\n  \"rate_output\": \"1.0\",\n  \"upstream_url\": \"https://api.openai.com/v1\",\n  \"api_key\": \"sk-xxx\"\n}\n```",
        "operationId": "createChannel",
        "security": [{ "ApiTokenAuth": [] }],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": ["name", "upstream_url"],
                "properties": {
                  "name": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "渠道名称（也作为 AI 调用时的模型名）",
                    "example": "deepseek-chat",
                    "minLength": 1
                  },
                  "api_standard": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "API 协议标准",
                    "default": "openai",
                    "example": "openai"
                  },
                  "price_input": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "输入单价（元/百万Token）",
                    "default": "0",
                    "example": "10"
                  },
                  "price_cached": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "缓存命中单价（元/百万Token）",
                    "default": "0",
                    "example": "5"
                  },
                  "price_output": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "输出单价（元/百万Token）",
                    "default": "0",
                    "example": "30"
                  },
                  "rate_input": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "输入 Token 汇率（将上游 Token 数转换为标准 Token 数）",
                    "default": "1.0",
                    "example": "1.0"
                  },
                  "rate_cached": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "缓存 Token 汇率",
                    "default": "1.0",
                    "example": "1.0"
                  },
                  "rate_output": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "输出 Token 汇率",
                    "default": "1.0",
                    "example": "1.0"
                  },
                  "upstream_url": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "上游 API 地址",
                    "example": "https://api.deepseek.com/v1",
                    "minLength": 1
                  },
                  "api_key": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "上游 API 密钥",
                    "default": "",
                    "example": "sk-xxx"
                  },
                  "channel_type": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "渠道厂商类型（deepseek/volcengine/qwen/baidu/tencent/openai/anthropic/google/custom）",
                    "default": "custom",
                    "example": "deepseek"
                  },
                  "price_reference_url": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "计费价格参考链接",
                    "default": "",
                    "example": "https://api-docs.deepseek.com/zh-cn/quick_start/pricing"
                  },
                  "model": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "上游实际调用的模型名（为空则使用渠道名）",
                    "default": "",
                    "example": "deepseek-chat"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "创建成功，返回新创建的渠道信息",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "success": { "type": "boolean", "example": true },
                    "data": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChannelInfo" }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest" },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/channels/{id}": {
      "put": {
        "tags": ["渠道管理"],
        "summary": "更新渠道",
        "description": "更新指定渠道的配置信息。只需传入需要更新的字段，未传入的字段保持不变。\n\n### 请求示例\n```json\n{\n  \"price_input\": \"0.02\",\n  \"price_output\": \"0.04\"\n}\n```",
        "operationId": "updateChannel",
        "security": [{ "ApiTokenAuth": [] }],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "description": "渠道 ID",
            "schema": { "type": "integer", "format": "int64", "example": 1 }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "description": "需要更新的字段，所有字段均为可选",
                "properties": {
                  "api_standard": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "API 协议标准",
                    "example": "openai"
                  },
                  "price_input": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "输入单价（元/百万Token）",
                    "example": "10"
                  },
                  "price_cached": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "缓存命中单价（元/百万Token）",
                    "example": "5"
                  },
                  "price_output": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "输出单价（元/百万Token）",
                    "example": "30"
                  },
                  "rate_input": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "输入 Token 汇率",
                    "example": "1.5"
                  },
                  "rate_cached": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "缓存 Token 汇率",
                    "example": "1.0"
                  },
                  "rate_output": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "输出 Token 汇率",
                    "example": "1.5"
                  },
                  "upstream_url": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "上游 API 地址",
                    "example": "https://api.deepseek.com/v1"
                  },
                  "api_key": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "上游 API 密钥",
                    "example": "sk-xxx"
                  },
                  "channel_type": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "渠道厂商类型（deepseek/volcengine/qwen/baidu/tencent/openai/anthropic/google/custom）",
                    "example": "deepseek"
                  },
                  "price_reference_url": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "计费价格参考链接",
                    "example": "https://api-docs.deepseek.com/zh-cn/quick_start/pricing"
                  },
                  "model": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "上游实际调用的模型名（为空则使用渠道名）",
                    "example": "deepseek-chat"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "更新成功，返回更新后的渠道信息",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "success": { "type": "boolean", "example": true },
                    "data": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChannelInfo" }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest" },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "404": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound" }
        }
      },
      "delete": {
        "tags": ["渠道管理"],
        "summary": "删除渠道",
        "description": "删除指定的渠道。删除后该渠道将无法用于 AI 调用。",
        "operationId": "deleteChannel",
        "security": [{ "ApiTokenAuth": [] }],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "description": "要删除的渠道 ID",
            "schema": { "type": "integer", "format": "int64", "example": 1 }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "删除成功",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "success": { "type": "boolean", "example": true },
                    "data": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "deleted": { "type": "boolean", "example": true },
                        "id": { "type": "integer", "example": 1 }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "404": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/token/generate": {
      "post": {
        "tags": ["Token 管理"],
        "summary": "生成 Token",
        "description": "生成一个新的 API Token，用于 AI 代理鉴权。Token 可使用所有已配置的渠道，无需绑定特定渠道。\n\n### 请求示例\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"我的应用\"\n}\n```\n\n### 响应示例\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"token\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n    \"label\": \"我的应用\",\n    \"balance\": \"0\"\n  }\n}\n```",
        "operationId": "generateToken",
        "security": [{ "ApiTokenAuth": [] }],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": ["label"],
                "properties": {
                  "label": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Token 标签，用于标识用途",
                    "example": "我的应用",
                    "minLength": 1
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "生成成功",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "success": { "type": "boolean", "example": true },
                    "data": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TokenGenerated" }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest" },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/tokens": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["Token 管理"],
        "summary": "获取 Token 列表",
        "description": "获取所有已生成的 Token 列表，包含余额、并发限制等信息。",
        "operationId": "listTokens",
        "security": [{ "ApiTokenAuth": [] }],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "成功返回 Token 列表",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "success": { "type": "boolean", "example": true },
                    "data": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TokenInfo" }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/tokens/{token}": {
      "delete": {
        "tags": ["Token 管理"],
        "summary": "删除 Token",
        "description": "删除（软删除）指定的 Token。删除后该 Token 将无法再用于 AI 代理鉴权。",
        "operationId": "deleteToken",
        "security": [{ "ApiTokenAuth": [] }],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "token",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "description": "要删除的 Token 值（UUID 格式）",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid",
              "example": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "删除成功",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "success": { "type": "boolean", "example": true },
                    "data": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "deleted": { "type": "boolean", "example": true },
                        "token": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "example": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "404": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/token/recharge": {
      "post": {
        "tags": ["积分管理"],
        "summary": "Token 充值",
        "description": "为指定 Token 充值积分。金额为字符串类型以支持高精度数值。\n\n### 请求示例\n```json\n{\n  \"token\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n  \"amount\": \"1000\"\n}\n```\n\n### 响应示例\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"success\": true,\n    \"message\": \"充值成功，当前余额: 1000\"\n  }\n}\n```",
        "operationId": "rechargeToken",
        "security": [{ "ApiTokenAuth": [] }],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": ["token", "amount"],
                "properties": {
                  "token": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "要充值的 Token 值",
                    "format": "uuid",
                    "example": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890"
                  },
                  "amount": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "充值金额（整数或小数，支持高精度）",
                    "example": "1000"
                  },
                  "remark": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "备注（默认为 管理员操作）",
                    "default": "管理员操作",
                    "example": "管理员操作"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "充值成功",
            "content": {
