        "description": "更新全局计费倍率。\n\n**计费公式：最终价格 = 渠道价格 × 倍率 × 100**\n\n### 请求示例\n```json\n{\n  \"multiplier\": \"1.5\"\n}\n```\n\n### 响应示例\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"success\": true,\n    \"message\": \"倍率已更新为 1.5\"\n  }\n}\n```",
        "operationId": "updatePricing",
        "security": [{ "ApiTokenAuth": [] }],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": ["multiplier"],
                "properties": {
                  "multiplier": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "新的全局倍率值（有效的正数）",
                    "example": "1.5"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "更新成功",
